<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">For additional information regarding our arrangement
with the underwriter, please see &ldquo;<I>Underwriting</I>&rdquo; beginning on page 80.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 7pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The underwriter expects to deliver the securities
against payment on November 30, 2023.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 7pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

