    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">We rely on email, internet search engines and application marketplaces to drive traffic to our ZCITY App, certain providers of which offer products and services that compete directly with our products. If links to our applications and website are not displayed prominently, traffic to our ZCITY App could decline and our business would be adversely affected;</FONT></TD></TR>
