our principal assets are located outside of the United States and all of our directors and officers reside outside of the United
States, it may be difficult for you to enforce your rights based on U.S. Federal Securities Laws against us and our officers and directors
or to enforce a judgment of a United States court against us or our officers and directors;</FONT></TD>
</TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

