    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-top: 0.75pt; padding-bottom: 0.75pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><I>Accrued
    promotion expense </I></FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
balance of accrued promotion expense represented the balance of profit sharing payable to the Company&rsquo;s merchant and subscribed
agents to promote business growth.</FONT></P>

